body:
`build_query` in `httpkit/query.py` joins `key=value` pairs with `&` but does not encode anything, so a search for `fish & chips` produces a broken URL. Please change it so that:

- keys and values are percent-encoded with `urllib.parse.quote` and `safe=""`, so a space becomes `%20`, `&` becomes `%26` and `/` becomes `%2F`;
- a parameter whose value is `None` is left out;
- a list or tuple value repeats the key once per element, in order (`{"tag": ["a", "b"]}` gives `tag=a&tag=b`), and an empty list adds nothing;
- other values are converted with `str()`.

Parameters keep the order of the dict.
